# Authorization matrix
Generated from `authorize` by its tests. ok = allowed, 403 = Forbidden, 404 = NotFound.

## Accounts and bots
Rows: the actor's role, and whose account it is. Columns: the grant the actor holds on it.

### ViewBot
actor   owner           no grant  view  control  manage
Owner   self            ok        ok    ok       ok
Owner   a Member        ok        ok    ok       ok
Owner   an Admin        ok        ok    ok       ok
Admin   self            ok        ok    ok       ok
Admin   a Member        ok        ok    ok       ok
Admin   another Admin   404       ok    ok       ok
Admin   the Owner       404       ok    ok       ok
Member  self            ok        ok    ok       ok
Member  another Member  404       ok    ok       ok
Member  an Admin        404       ok    ok       ok
Member  the Owner       404       ok    ok       ok

